  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－排球",
    "sub_ename": "VOLLEYBALL",
    "describe_ch": "兩場中央隔張網  發球瞬間及啟動\r\n移動步伐接發球  指揮配球二傳手\r\n聲東擊西群發動  貼身快扣速如風\r\n背後安置破擊炮  長攻重擊威如爆\r\n對區欄防嚴如哨  左右開立面對網\r\n躍起伸臂展空防  全面反攻定江山\r\n得球得分殺殺殺  排球運動真優雅",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to teach students the fundamental skills ,rules and team tactics of volleyball in order for them to become participants and spectators for this lifetime team sports. More specifically, the course covers the following skills areas: forearm passing, overhead passing, spiking, blocking, serving, serve reception, offensive systems, and defensive systems.",
